{"time": 1767521707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572091446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐也帮我们个忙吧，我们就考虑考虑”"}
{"time": 1767521851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113354092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"一时没反应过来，不过没有接话，看看伊恩是什么打算。"}
{"time": 1767522009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526424842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们有事找卡坤，但他好像很忙的样子，姐姐要是能帮我们见到他的话，我们去天空之塔碰碰运气也不是不可以...”"}
{"time": 1767522176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159442017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"伸手拉了拉伊恩，小声开口，\"我们等在这...那家伙会自己过来的，答应她去塔干嘛？\""}
{"time": 1767522202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886084502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我有点好奇..想去看看”小声回应"}
{"time": 1767522218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914598991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "毕竟龙什么的，自己还从来没见过"}
{"time": 1767522345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679092883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那也得要点别的什么吧...药品支援什么的...\"皱了皱眉，\"偷偷进塔NG哦——\""}
{"time": 1767522365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802151305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么在我吃饭的时候整活）"}
{"time": 1767522404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642122499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"要是能再送我们点药就更好了...”急忙补充道"}
{"time": 1767522516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53441357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"另外，短时间都不会去的。\"补充，叹了口气，手指绞了绞发丝。"}
{"time": 1767522523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664249710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（实际上塔里人绝对不会少）"}
{"time": 1767522545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103956617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你们这么多条件开出来很难答应啊）"}
{"time": 1767522549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450280865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（确实，所以其实大概没那么危险）"}
{"time": 1767522577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067621444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”小声把头靠在舒茉耳边“等下好像也没什么事吧，去看看好像也没什么不好的”"}
{"time": 1767522735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127958476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我什么时候能插话呢（）"}
{"time": 1767522782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046549586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手指揉碎另一边的发丝，掩盖有些害羞的心情，\"今天去吗？待会还要跟妈妈吃晚饭吧...\""}
{"time": 1767522815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297486362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在还早吧”看看天色"}
{"time": 1767522996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604986178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"先安定下来吧...学院里还不知道是什么样子。\""}
{"time": 1767523235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311641682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "转头看着萝莉安，\"嗯...\"等她开口"}
{"time": 1767523276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310220855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=572091446]“我可不是在求你”她金色的眉毛蹙了蹙“西海岸里还没几个人敢这么跟我得寸进尺。要不是协会那群老古板……”"}
{"time": 1767523360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468710545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你们要是这两天不去，我就去找别人了，反正我也不缺追求者”她用手指缠着自己宛如金线织成的头发“相反，你们要是能早早完成，少不了你们的报酬”"}
{"time": 1767523403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632195411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"察觉到她话里的古怪之处，\"程序上不允许吧？事后追究起来怎么办?\""}
{"time": 1767523462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410610019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（程序是什么）"}
{"time": 1767523477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596363116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不被发现不就好了？而且你们不是协会的人吧？”"}
{"time": 1767523625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138857112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看舒茉怎么说，自己听她的"}
{"time": 1767523644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915009478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她看起来满不在意，大概她有公主病这事也不是空穴来风"}
{"time": 1767523765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527462070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"很难想象眼前的人会不被发现，摇摇头，\"恕难从命，虽然我们近期有进塔的打算。\""}
{"time": 1767523785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371797850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看时间，那个倒霉家伙怎么还没到"}
{"time": 1767523789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808740146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她说的是你们不被发现）"}
{"time": 1767523929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493877570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=527462070]（什么意思）"}
{"time": 1767523991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094238704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那也恕难从命)"}
{"time": 1767523999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579390070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=147172267]（说是这么说，你们约了时间吗）"}
{"time": 1767524008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279017451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(就是拒绝啊，风险太大)"}
{"time": 1767524021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555726598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1579390070](在这里等他的方案吧)"}
{"time": 1767524769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547758192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”她嘴角优雅的微笑有点绷不住，扭过来皮笑肉不笑地看着伊恩“你呢？反正你也要进塔。这么简单的任务，一个人也能完成的吧？”"}
{"time": 1767524835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720950321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的简单吗...”虽然自己蛮想去的“我不可能一个人去的啦”再看看天色"}
{"time": 1767524908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "107768375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（谁让你一个人去了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767524924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587564333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原本任务发给两个人，现在给你一个）"}
{"time": 1767524952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747800170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说到底也就是个顺路的事.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767524988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772458301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"跟着侧过头看着伊恩"}
{"time": 1767525307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490873456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我听舒茉的”舒茉不愿意去的话还是算了"}
{"time": 1767525394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424253462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "日渐西斜，从这个角度看过去，落日被天空之塔正好一分为二，但光晕淹没了当中的一部分，倒像是一颗橘子味的棒棒糖。罗莉安矜持的微笑慢慢沉没，生硬地结束了话题“时间到了，我要打烊了。两位快离开吧。”"}
{"time": 1767525505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878356521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "既然不太愉快，那就只能在此作别，往门外走，\"再见，姐姐。\"提起裙子行了个不太熟练的礼。"}
{"time": 1767525538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780216126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（下次记得叫漂亮的姐姐（））"}
{"time": 1767525539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666201077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃...再见”拿上药水转身和舒茉离开"}
{"time": 1767525667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726934230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没等到啊...我们要不再回去那边看看?\"心里暗暗给萝莉安划上不好相处的标签。"}
{"time": 1767525947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309497376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看样子只能去排队了”"}
{"time": 1767525954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055174020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（约了时间，那你约了地点吗.jpg）"}
