{"time": 1767543993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246634362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=335334589]“哦，晚上好？”她抬头看了一眼，又低头看她的爱恨情仇“卡坤还没回来，应该看得出来吧？”"}
{"time": 1767544121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565762599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过应该也快了，再怎么工作狂，晚饭也总得吃的……吧？”"}
{"time": 1767544286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530786694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "我看未必，胸中腹诽，但是没说出来，转头看向伊恩，等他拿主意。"}
{"time": 1767544333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631165942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...要不先去和阿姨汇合吧..”"}
{"time": 1767544533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109139353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...约定一下时间地点?阿尼亚姐姐可以帮个忙吗？\""}
{"time": 1767544604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041401337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来是没搞定萝莉安？”她干笑两声“你们说个地儿吧，我尽量说动他”"}
{"time": 1767544804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021510751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"商会那边?时间的话，明天中午?\""}
{"time": 1767545333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490410173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行啊。”她打个响指，光芒编织成线，在信封上落下注释。也不知道她为什么这么热心，大概是……摸鱼摸得心情比较好"}
{"time": 1767545428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098114748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢姐姐”"}
{"time": 1767545519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818757206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谢谢阿尼亚姐姐。\"松了口气，开启下个话题，\"萝莉安姐姐一直是这样吗？\""}
{"time": 1767545690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766297799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“差不多吧，大概是生活太如意了”她起身拿了点大厅的免费零食，又坐回去看她的小说“家庭美满相貌出众，魔法天赋也算得上万里挑一，就算整天一副目中无人的样子也有大把人追……哎，我也想”"}
{"time": 1767545748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46047057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(查询app)"}
{"time": 1767545758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867667473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（谁的）"}
{"time": 1767545780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749015959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉好像听起来和舒茉差不多，不过舒茉的性格感觉比她好多了..这样想想感觉自己好幸福"}
{"time": 1767545813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829942844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的，马上就刷新情敌出来）"}
{"time": 1767545910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027805397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（百分制的话，萝莉安大概是93？阿尼亚也就78这样（）"}
{"time": 1767545928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150279491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说阿尼亚用紫苑的立绘是不是就懂了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1767545948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800552916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是翔哥不认识，以及紫苑其实是服装店老板）"}
{"time": 1767545964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744257412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1767546073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277415198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...阿尼亚姐姐也很好看了。\"仔细打量，\"追姐姐的人一定也很多啦。\""}
{"time": 1767546185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901278000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她不好意思地笑了两声“借你吉言，不过能把人换算成钱就更好了，男人哪有钱有意思……”"}
{"time": 1767546194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645989216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那女人呢）"}
{"time": 1767546200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332314245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好吧其实立绘是青雀）"}
{"time": 1767546406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865803171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "微微歪头，\"那...下次再见?\""}
{"time": 1767546423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713744429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "挥手告别“姐姐再见”"}
{"time": 1767546480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415717554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“拜拜，等你们入了学说不定还会见面的”她可算是又抬了抬头，目送你们出了门"}
{"time": 1767546683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987608025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "出门看看天色，偏头递出手的同时轻声开口，带着些故意的狡黠，\"伊恩呐，我问你一个问题，要诚实回答哦?\""}
{"time": 1767546797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199403904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "牵上“什么问题”有点疑惑“我肯定不会骗舒茉的”"}
{"time": 1767546942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050809077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（彩礼？）"}
{"time": 1767546984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973188544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"萝莉安小姐，阿尼亚小姐和我——谁比较好看?要诚实哦?不能掺杂主观因素。\""}
{"time": 1767547081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516276717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当然是舒茉啊”不加思索的回答"}
{"time": 1767547141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093647361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不如问萝莉安和阿尼亚哪个好看，好像更有挑战性一点（）"}
{"time": 1767547208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889305631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "晚霞的余晖正在渐渐散去，鱼鳞般的云层慢慢降温。海风轻拂，涛声阵阵。滨海城市带来的是前所未有的开放感。好像一切都和海鸟一样，只是过客，于是每个人都被赋予自由的权力"}
{"time": 1767547377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596697521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一听就是主观因素满满的话诶?\"用另一只没被牵着的手戳戳，\"可信度好低。\""}
{"time": 1767547393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786341690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么不问萝莉安和舒茉）"}
{"time": 1767547533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906770673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(问了三个人)"}
{"time": 1767547537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283289295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，肺腑之言啦，要不舒茉趴这里听一听”指指自己左胸口"}
{"time": 1767547631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387968076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"偏过头，耳朵尖有些红，\"我不要，这可是大街上。\"深吸口气再开口，\"但是舒茉只是小村子里的女孩，比不过她们的啦...这点我还是有自知之明的啦。\""}
{"time": 1767547824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540698918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这跟出身有什么关系，舒茉就是漂亮啊，自信一点啦...”摇摇头“感觉之后到学院会有不少人追舒茉呢，我得更加努力才行啊”"}
{"time": 1767547954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313111627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总感觉再说下去会是自己先坚持不住，深呼吸...深呼吸...\"不说这个了，快到了吧？\""}
{"time": 1767548175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176484471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "确实快到了。突然出现的神秘高塔多少还是影响了些城里的店铺，有的门口已经贴上了“有事暂歇”的字样，但空气中依旧杂糅着数不清的香味。胆大的白翅膀海鸟扑闪着翅膀落地，肆无忌惮地争抢着厨余"}
{"time": 1767548332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459891064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有点好奇晚上会吃什么了。\"牵着的手握紧了一些，带着一些对未来的不确定开口，\"在这里感觉会待很久呢...\""}
{"time": 1767548335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515221260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们来的时候寄存行李的商会，某种意义上可以算得上不太起眼，在各色门店中也不过是没什么特色的其中之一"}
{"time": 1767548422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835753909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...不知道要上几年学啊”"}
{"time": 1767548543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733272342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过靠海的话，晚上可能会吃海鲜？”"}
{"time": 1767548626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326789136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "进去看看妈妈在不在，\"很少能吃到海鲜呢...必须得试一试了。\"点头认可"}
{"time": 1767548703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717896010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "在的在的"}
{"time": 1767548754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459026097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾和汉斯坐在休息区，手边没拿什么东西，看起来还在讨论什么"}
{"time": 1767548783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910602526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "先听一听在说什么"}
{"time": 1767548824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387226709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们来了肯定先和你们打招呼了啊（）"}
{"time": 1767548835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862900314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（除非你要，过个潜行）"}
{"time": 1767548850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038858916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1767548879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776985260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "径直走到妈妈旁边，\"妈——在聊什么?\""}
{"time": 1767549152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566176275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，在说房子的事——今天下午我和你爸看了几家，最后有两家备选。”舒蕾和你招招手，表情有些微妙“其中一家中规中矩，离学校和商业区都不远，价格也能接受。说不定还能和莫辛她们摊一下”"}
{"time": 1767549253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057285565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"也跟着坐下来，贴在母亲身边。"}
{"time": 1767549403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583913319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“另外一家……很微妙。是一栋精装房，家居什么的都好很多，地段在学院和协会之间，租金不高，但是房主有个条件……”"}
{"time": 1767549432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334515024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“条件？”"}
{"time": 1767549578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518773183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“租客得是魔法学院的学生，而且要和他家的孩子……呃，‘深入交流’，入学成绩还得排进年级前20%……总感觉是控制欲很强的家长”"}
